rtedContractVersions has no production gate map by design).\n+- FIX (B3): new `TestRefusalConstructorsMatchProduction` derives the constructor denominator from production — every `axerror.New` site must sit inside a registered constructor body, and the registered set must equal the error-constructing vars exactly. The inventory header sentence now states what both gates do.\n+- FIX (N4): new `TestCheckCallBindingZeroFactsRefuse` — all five `CheckCallBinding` zero-fact exemptions refuse through their own arms.\n+- FIX (N5): `vocabularyTablesInFile` handles shared and paired multi-name initializers (synthetic vectors added); the tagless-switch exemption is confined to `readUTF16Escape` by function name (`classifySwitch` + `TestSwitchClassifierNamesItsExemption`); the census stated bound now names the function-local obligation lists (pinned behaviourally, both directions) and the const/regexp shapes (absent from production).\n+- EVIDENCE: narrowing-mutant battery over the rework scope, every mutant grep-confirmed present and compiling before its verdict; full gates green (see the attached rework-evidence note).\n+\n+### 0444 — Session-adapter leaf rework: all four blocking verdict findings closed, one anomaly reported\n"}}}
